      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:15 I passed through the square; around 07:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 11:15 I was at the mill; around 11:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:26 I passed through the square; from about 11:30 to 12:00 I was at the grocery; around 12:04 I passed through the square; around 12:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 12:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:22 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
