      "key": "K0047",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:15 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 23:06 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 21900,
      "topics": [
