      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16, from about 05:00 I was at home; at the mill from about 08:30; at the grocery from about 09:15; home around 17:15; at the Okafor house from about 18:15; at the Crooked Pike from about 19:15; home around 22:00 and to bed.",
