      "key": "K0095",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the mill; around 09:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:00 I was at the grocery; around 17:04 I passed through the square; around 17:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at the Okafor house; around 19:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:16 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:01 I passed through the square; around 22:03 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:00 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 21900,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
