      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16, from about 05:00 I was at home; at the mill from about 07:15; home around 16:30; at the grocery from about 17:30; at the Crooked Pike from about 18:15; home around 21:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 21900,
