      "in": "K0203",
      "key": "K0204",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:26 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:08 I passed through the square; around 09:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 13:15 I was at home; around 13:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 13:22 I passed through the square; from about 13:30 to 14:15 I was at the Pryce house; around 14:15 I passed through the square; around 14:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 14:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 21900,
