      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0252",
      "key": "K0253",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 09:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:06 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:00 I was at the clinic; around 17:06 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:05 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 21900,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
