      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:18 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:12 I passed through the square; around 09:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:30 to 10:15 I was at the mill; around 10:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 10:15 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
