      "in": "K0429",
      "key": "K0430",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 16: from about 05:00 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:09 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 10:00 I was at the grocery; around 10:05 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:15 I was at the Pryce house; around 11:13 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 23:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 23:04 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 21900,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
